<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Foodbrands America.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Foodbrands America.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it downgraded Foodbrands America Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Cited announcement that IBP Inc agreed to buy Foodbrands for $23.40 cash.</p>
<p>-- Said that with the current stock price reflecting the tender offer price, the brokerage did not see any upside to Foodbrands' shares.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed Wednesday at 23-1/8.</p>
</text>
